title Booking Agent

component booking-webapp as "Booking Webapp" web-application
component booking-api as "Booking API" service
component booking-db as "Booking Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> booking-webapp
north -> booking-api

booking-webapp -> booking-api
booking-webapp -> user-auth
booking-api -> user-auth
booking-api -> booking-db
